&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional tradeoffs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&amp;nbsp;Overview&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Software Development Manager to lead a team within the Supply Chain Management &amp;amp; Automation (SCMA) organization, the group building the automated systems behind Coupang’s procurement and inventory operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCMA&amp;nbsp;powers&amp;nbsp;critical&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;decisions&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;what&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;order,&amp;nbsp;how&amp;nbsp;much&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;order,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;when&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;procure,&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;massive&amp;nbsp;scale&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;millions&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;SKUs&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;thousands&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead a lean, high-impact team developing distributed systems that drive the end-to-end ordering lifecycle, from demand forecasting and inventory planning to supplier integration and execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own both technical direction and delivery, driving complex initiatives in a fast-paced, large-scale environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;opportunity&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;large-scale&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;automate&amp;nbsp;procurement&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;inventory&amp;nbsp;decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;handling&amp;nbsp;high-volume&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;workloads&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;suppliers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;expand&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;scale&amp;nbsp;Coupang’s&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;regions&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;Taiwan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;problems&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;forecasting,&amp;nbsp;inventory&amp;nbsp;optimization,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;supplier&amp;nbsp;constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;high&amp;nbsp;ownership&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;lean&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;while&amp;nbsp;influencing&amp;nbsp;broader&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;direction&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;microservices,&amp;nbsp;big&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;systems,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;real-time&amp;nbsp;decision&amp;nbsp;platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;Will&amp;nbsp;Do&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead,&amp;nbsp;hire,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;develop&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;high-performing&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;backend&amp;nbsp;engineers&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;automation&amp;nbsp;systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;key&amp;nbsp;initiatives&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;ordering,&amp;nbsp;inventory,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;procurement&amp;nbsp;platforms,&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;timelines&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;cross-team&amp;nbsp;dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;architecture&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;handling&amp;nbsp;SKU&amp;nbsp;management,&amp;nbsp;ordering&amp;nbsp;pipelines,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;supplier&amp;nbsp;workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;translate&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;requirements&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;scalable&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;distributed,&amp;nbsp;high-scale&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;inventory,&amp;nbsp;supplier,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;demand&amp;nbsp;data,&amp;nbsp;driving&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;decisions&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;microservices&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;excellence&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;high&amp;nbsp;standards&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;code&amp;nbsp;quality,&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;reliability,&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;readiness,&amp;nbsp;while&amp;nbsp;mentoring&amp;nbsp;engineers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;contributing&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;critical&amp;nbsp;challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–13&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;3+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Java-based&amp;nbsp;backend&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;microservices&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;designing&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;large-scale,&amp;nbsp;data-intensive&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;involving&amp;nbsp;batch&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;stream&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;Spark,&amp;nbsp;Kafka,&amp;nbsp;Airflow&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep&amp;nbsp;understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;design&amp;nbsp;fundamentals&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;scalability,&amp;nbsp;fault&amp;nbsp;tolerance,&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;consistency,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;high-volume&amp;nbsp;datasets&amp;nbsp;(millions&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;SKUs,&amp;nbsp;transactions,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;entities)&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;involve&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;decision&amp;nbsp;logic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;modern&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;ecosystems&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;warehouses,&amp;nbsp;relational/NoSQL&amp;nbsp;databases,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;caching&amp;nbsp;layers&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;Redshift,&amp;nbsp;MySQL,&amp;nbsp;Redis)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;—&amp;nbsp;breaking&amp;nbsp;down&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;platform&amp;nbsp;problems&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;scalable&amp;nbsp;designs&amp;nbsp;while&amp;nbsp;staying&amp;nbsp;hands-on&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;critical&amp;nbsp;areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain,&amp;nbsp;logistics,&amp;nbsp;procurement,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;inventory&amp;nbsp;systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;large-scale&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;processing&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;(Spark,&amp;nbsp;Kafka,&amp;nbsp;Airflow,&amp;nbsp;etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;scaling&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;involving&amp;nbsp;SKU&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;supply&amp;nbsp;chain&amp;nbsp;decisioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;systems,&amp;nbsp;event-driven&amp;nbsp;architecture,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;high-growth,&amp;nbsp;fast-paced&amp;nbsp;environments&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;large&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;ability&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;lean&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;high&amp;nbsp;ownership&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type of Work Model :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;Onsite&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;Remote&amp;nbsp;working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Hybrid work model enables collaboration while offering flexibility. Employees are expected to work at least 3 days in the office, with the option to work remotely depending on role requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;Consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment in accordance with applicable laws.&lt;/p&gt;
